	(text_box "This PCB contains high speed analog and digital signals that should be routed with specific impedance profiles, using coplanar microstrip, stripline and differential routing techniques.\n\nDetails such as the specific impedance profile, trace width and trace spacing can be found in the layout notes in each sub-sheet of this PCB.\n\nThe impedance profiles are included in the Layer Stack Manager of this project and will only be accurate if the following aspects are specified when ordering:\n\nLayers = 6\nInner copper weight = 0.5oz\nOuter copper weight = 0.5oz + plating\nPCB thickness = 1.6mm\nManufacturer = NCAB\nStack-up Code = 6ML BOARD - 1,6MM\n\nYou can find the details of the stackup 6ML BOARD - 1,6MM:"
